error[E0277]: `String` cannot be stored in a `numeric` field
 --> tests/ui/wrong_type_for_kind.rs:6:8
  |
6 |     a: String,
  |        ^^^^^^ use `u8`, `u16`, `u32`, `u64`, a `#[derive(Code)]` enum with integer codes, or an `Option` of one
  |
  = help: the trait `NumericField` is not implemented for `String`
  = help: the following other types implement trait `NumericField`:
            Option<T>
            bryl::Const
            u16
            u32
            u64
            u8
note: required by a bound in `bryl::__private::assert_numeric`
 --> src/lib.rs
  |
  |     pub const fn assert_numeric<T: NumericField>() {}
  |                                    ^^^^^^^^^^^^ required by this bound in `assert_numeric`

